### Mechanic: Bell Collision & Streak Protocol
INTENT: Detects puck impact at bell height, awards tickets with streak multiplier, shifts the bell, and resets the puck if the collision fails.
PSEUDO:
  if puck.y >= bell.y then
    multiplier = Engine.GetStreak()
    Engine.AwardTickets(1 * multiplier, "bell_hit")
    MoveKinematic(bell_handle, 0, bell_offset, 0, 0.1)
    SetLinearVelocity(puck_handle, 0, -5, 0)
  else
    SetLinearVelocity(puck_handle, 0, -10, 0)
  end
API:
  MoveKinematic(bell_handle, 0, bell_offset, 0, 0.1)
